#                and in the editor, and previewable against a real engagement.
#
#              role catalog + capability matrix — the eighteen roles were
#                already right and already enforced; nothing said so anywhere a
#                person could look. permissions.ts describes auth/rbac.ts and
#                is asserted against it role by role, so the two cannot drift.
